  "2026-08-10T07:04:11.182Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched all statuses for workspace snapshot lease staging ENOENT,heartbeat races,Auto Release failure,and GH-959. Closed pm-ifuysd fixed the activation heartbeat rename race; run 31361402293 exposes a distinct recurrence in planning/test synchronization after that fix,so this item records the new failure rather than reopening or duplicating the closed resolution."
  "2026-08-10T08:26:23.807Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: snapshot restore acquires and immediately renews its lease before planning, serializes heartbeat renewal, exposes explicit refresh, and preserves the first renewal failure. The recurrence test now uses deterministic lease contention instead of wall-clock mass-file timing. Clean-directory create/preview/restore and all 7141 tests pass."
  "2026-08-10T08:46:00.999Z","harness:codex","CodeRabbit feedback implemented: heartbeatStopped is marked active before awaited activation refresh so outer cleanup cannot leak a restarted interval on refresh failure. The lease test now writes an expired lock deterministically, calls refreshNow without starting the periodic scheduler, and proves competing acquisition is rejected."
  "2026-08-10T08:53:30.046Z","harness:codex","Review-fix verification: deterministic expired-lease refresh and activation-failure cleanup changes pass the focused snapshot suite and exact repository coverage at 100/100/100/100."
